# Deterministic stock-desktop route for the current DOS PAL data set.
# Format: <virtual-tick-ms> state <direction> <key-mask>
# key-mask 0x2 is kKeySearch. The first event skips the splash screen;
# later search events accept the default "new game" menu choice and advance
# the first scene's opening dialog/script path.
0 state 0 0x2
15000 state 0 0x2
15500 state 0 0x2
16000 state 0 0x2
16500 state 0 0x2
17000 state 0 0x2
17500 state 0 0x2
18000 state 0 0x2
18500 state 0 0x2
19000 state 0 0x2
19500 state 0 0x2
20000 state 0 0x2
20500 state 0 0x2
21000 state 0 0x2
